{"seq":1,"slug":"cvrdt-semilattice","title":"状态 CRDT 与半格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/cvrdt-semilattice","wordCount":1472,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态-crdt-与半格\">状态 CRDT 与半格</h1><p>状态型 CRDT 看上去像是一堆需要逐个验证收敛的数据结构，但 Shapiro 等人 2011 年的关键贡献是证明了：只要状态空间是一个连接半格、本地更新单调、合并取上确界，那么收敛就<strong>自动成立</strong>，你一行收敛证明都不用单独写。这一篇把这台「免费收敛机」拆开，看清它每一颗螺丝——之后 <a href=\"counters\">计数器</a> 与 <a href=\"sets\">集合</a> 都只是把数据塞进这台机器而已。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>连接半格（join-semilattice）</strong>：偏序集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S, \\le)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中任意两个元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 都有上确界（least upper bound）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\sqcup b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，称为 join。join 必满足交换律、结合律、幂等律。</li>\n<li><strong>join 与偏序等价</strong>：任何满足这三条的二元运算都唯一确定一个偏序，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\le b \\iff a\\sqcup b=b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。「半格」与「满足三律的合并」是同一件事的两种说法。</li>\n<li><strong>单调更新</strong>：每次更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 把状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s\\le u(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即状态只升不降。</li>\n<li><strong>免费收敛</strong>：状态空间是半格 + 本地更新单调 + 合并取 join，三者凑齐，强最终一致性（SEC）的强收敛条款自动成立，无需逐类型写收敛证明。</li>\n<li><strong>可组合性</strong>：半格可乘积、可映射、可集合并，复合体自动仍是半格、自动仍收敛，这是后续所有结构的搭建法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"连接半格的三条公理\">连接半格的三条公理</h2><p>一个偏序集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S, \\le)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是连接半格（join-semilattice），如果任意两个元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a, b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 都有上确界（least upper bound，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\sqcup b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，称为 join）。这个 join 运算必然满足三条性质：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(交换律)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\sqcup b = b \\sqcup a \\quad\\text{(交换律)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交换律</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊔</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(结合律)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a \\sqcup b) \\sqcup c = a \\sqcup (b \\sqcup c) \\quad\\text{(结合律)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">结合律</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(幂等律)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\sqcup a = a \\quad\\text{(幂等律)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">幂等律</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这三条正是上一章 <a href=\"../foundations/why-crdts\">为什么需要 CRDT</a> 里要求合并函数具备的性质。反过来，任何满足这三条的二元运算都唯一确定一个偏序：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\le b \\iff a \\sqcup b = b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。也就是说，「半格」和「满足交换、结合、幂等的合并」是同一件事的两种说法。CRDT 设计者的全部工作，就是为目标数据结构找到这样一个 join。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单调更新与收敛证明\">单调更新与收敛证明</h2><p>光有半格还不够，还需要本地更新是<strong>单调</strong>的：每次更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 把状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，必须保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\le u(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即状态只升不降。把合并定为 join、更新定为单调函数，收敛证明就短到几乎不像证明：</p>\n<p>设两个副本各自见过的更新集合相同，那么它们的状态都等于「初始状态 join 上所有这些更新结果」。由于 join 交换、结合、幂等，无论这些更新以什么顺序、合并多少次、是否重复，join 出来的结果都是同一个上确界。于是「见过相同更新集合 ⇒ 状态相等」——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/eventual-consistency\">最终一致性与收敛</a> 里 SEC 的强收敛条款。三条公理各自对应一种网络异常的免疫：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理</th>\n<th>对应免疫的网络异常</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交换律</td>\n<td>消息乱序</td>\n<td>先合并谁都一样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结合律</td>\n<td>任意分批合并</td>\n<td>怎么分组都一样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等律</td>\n<td>消息重复 / 重传</td>\n<td>重复合并无副作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单调更新</td>\n<td>状态回退</td>\n<td>永不丢失已有信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一台可视化的机器\">一台可视化的机器</h2><p>把状态型 CRDT 的运转想成在半格的偏序图上「向上爬」：每个副本从底元素出发，本地更新让它沿偏序上升，合并则把两个副本拉到它们的共同上确界，所有副本最终汇聚到同一个顶点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  BOT[&quot;底元素 ⊥&lt;br/&gt;初始状态&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;副本1 状态 sa&lt;br/&gt;本地更新后&quot;]&#10;  BOT --&gt; B[&quot;副本2 状态 sb&lt;br/&gt;本地更新后&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; J[&quot;sa ⊔ sb&lt;br/&gt;上确界 = 收敛态&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; TOP[&quot;继续更新仍单调上升&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  BOT[\"底元素 ⊥&lt;br/&gt;初始状态\"] --&gt; A[\"副本1 状态 sa&lt;br/&gt;本地更新后\"]\n  BOT --&gt; B[\"副本2 状态 sb&lt;br/&gt;本地更新后\"]\n  A --&gt; J[\"sa ⊔ sb&lt;br/&gt;上确界 = 收敛态\"]\n  B --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; TOP[\"继续更新仍单调上升\"]</pre><h2 id=\"复合-从小半格搭大半格\">复合：从小半格搭大半格</h2><p>半格最实用的性质是<strong>可组合</strong>。这让我们能从平凡半格搭出复杂结构，而组合体自动仍是半格、自动仍收敛：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>乘积</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 都是半格，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\times T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 在逐分量 join 下也是半格。PN-Counter 就是两个 G-Counter 的乘积，见 <a href=\"counters\">计数器</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>映射</strong>：从键到半格值的映射，按「键取并、公共键的值取 join」合并，仍是半格。这是 OR-Map 的骨架，见 <a href=\"../op-based/maps-registers\">映射与寄存器</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>集合并</strong>：幂集在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∪</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∪</span></span></span></span></span> 下是半格，底元素是空集。G-Set 直接就是它，见 <a href=\"sets\">集合</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>整数在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 下是半格（join 即取较大者，底元素是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 或 0），这是几乎所有计数器与版本号的基石；自然数向量在逐分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 下是半格，这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/eventual-consistency\">最终一致性与收敛</a> 里向量时钟的代数本质——向量时钟的「逐分量取最大」就是它所在半格的 join。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态型的代价\">状态型的代价</h2><p>免费收敛不是没有账单。状态型 CRDT 每次同步都要传整个状态，对一个百万元素的集合或一段长文档，每次心跳都搬一遍全量显然不可接受。此外，为了让删除也保持单调（删除不能让状态「变小」），通常得保留墓碑，导致状态只增不减地膨胀。前者由 <a href=\"../practice/delta-crdts\">Delta CRDT</a> 用增量传播解决，后者则是 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs\">陷阱与权衡</a> 里垃圾回收要面对的难题。理解了半格这台机器的能力边界，正好为这两篇埋下伏笔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>连接半格 = 满足交换、结合、幂等的 join 运算 = 由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\le b \\iff a\\sqcup b=b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 诱导的偏序，三种说法等价。</li>\n<li>状态空间是半格 + 本地更新单调 + 合并取 join，三者凑齐，SEC 强收敛免费成立，无需逐类型证明。</li>\n<li>三条公理分别免疫消息乱序、任意分批、消息重复，单调性免疫状态回退。</li>\n<li>半格可乘积、可映射、可并，复合体自动仍收敛——这是后续所有结构的搭建法。</li>\n<li>代价是全量传输与墓碑膨胀，分别留给 <a href=\"../practice/delta-crdts\">Delta CRDT</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs\">陷阱与权衡</a>。最简单的实例从 <a href=\"counters\">计数器</a> 开始。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态 CRDT 与半格","id":"状态-crdt-与半格"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"连接半格的三条公理","id":"连接半格的三条公理"},{"level":2,"text":"单调更新与收敛证明","id":"单调更新与收敛证明"},{"level":2,"text":"一台可视化的机器","id":"一台可视化的机器"},{"level":2,"text":"复合：从小半格搭大半格","id":"复合-从小半格搭大半格"},{"level":2,"text":"状态型的代价","id":"状态型的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CRDT 类型概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/foundations/crdt-types-overview"},"next":{"title":"计数器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/counters"}}